async function voidExpenseIncome(payload = {}) { const operationId = Number(payload.operationId); return withConnection(async connection => { const ctx = await modernContext(connection, payload.context || {}); const result = await connection.execute(`update onyx_expense_income set status_code='VOID' where operation_id=:operation_id and company_id=:company_id and branch_id=:branch_id and status_code<>'VOID'`, { operation_id: operationId, company_id: ctx.COMPANY_ID, branch_id: ctx.BRANCH_ID }); if (result.rowsAffected !== 1) throw new Error('العملية غير موجودة أو ملغاة مسبقًا.'); await connection.commit(); return { operationId, status: 'VOID' }; }); }
